#@ Delegate two review perspectives and combine their findings.

agic review:
  recall = none
  tools = none
  hands = correctness_review, maintainability_review

  Review this code or diff. Use correctness_review and maintainability_review
  as hands, passing the complete input to each. Wait for both results and
  combine them into a short, prioritized review without duplicate findings.
  Mark assumptions and list useful checks. Do not claim tests were run.

  {{_}}

agic correctness_review:
  recall = none
  tools = none

  Review this code or diff for incorrect behavior, missed edge cases, and
  missing error handling. Return only actionable findings supported by the
  supplied text, or state that no concrete issue was found.

  {{_}}

agic maintainability_review:
  recall = none
  tools = none

  Review this code or diff for unnecessary complexity, unclear ownership,
  and fragile coupling. Return only actionable findings supported by the
  supplied text, or state that no concrete issue was found.

  {{_}}
